{"headword":"שִׁפְחָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. maid, maid-servant (</strong>syn. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָמָה</span>, q.v.; orig. = <em>concubine</em>? cf. √<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:1\" href=\"/Genesis.16.1\">Gn 16:1</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁפְחַת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:2\" href=\"/Genesis.16.2\">2</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁפְחָתִי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:2\" href=\"/Genesis.16.2\">2</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁפְחָתֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:13\" href=\"/Ruth.2.13\">Ru 2:13</a>, etc.; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁפָחוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:16\" href=\"/Genesis.12.16\">12:16</a> +; etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"lit., <em>maid, maid-servant,</em> as belonging to a mistress <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:1\" href=\"/Genesis.16.1\">Gn 16:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:3\" href=\"/Genesis.16.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:6\" href=\"/Genesis.16.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:8\" href=\"/Genesis.16.8\">8</a> (PJ) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:24\" href=\"/Genesis.29.24\">29:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:29\" href=\"/Genesis.29.29\">29</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 123:2\" href=\"/Psalms.123.2\">ψ 123:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.23\">Pr 30:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.2\">Is 24:2</a>; even where concubine of master (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אָמָה\" href=\"/BDB,_אָמָה\", dir=\"rtl\">אָמָה</a>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:2\" href=\"/Genesis.16.2\">Gn 16:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:5\" href=\"/Genesis.16.5\">5</a> (PJ) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:12\" href=\"/Genesis.25.12\">25:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:25\" href=\"/Genesis.35.25\">35:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:26\" href=\"/Genesis.35.26\">26</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:4\" href=\"/Genesis.30.4\">30:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:7\" href=\"/Genesis.30.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:9\" href=\"/Genesis.30.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:10\" href=\"/Genesis.30.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:12\" href=\"/Genesis.30.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:18\" href=\"/Genesis.30.18\">18</a> (all JE); less often ref. to master <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:24\" href=\"/Genesis.29.24\">29:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:29\" href=\"/Genesis.29.29\">29</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:13\" href=\"/Ruth.2.13\">Ru 2:13</a>, of concubine <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:23\" href=\"/Genesis.32.23\">Gn 32:23</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:1\" href=\"/Genesis.33.1\">33:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:2\" href=\"/Genesis.33.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:6\" href=\"/Genesis.33.6\">6</a> (all J); marriageable <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.20\">Lv 19:20</a> (H, cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:5\" href=\"/Exodus.11.5\">Ex 11:5</a>; not elsewhere in legisl.); in gen., especially of menial service (never <span dir=\"rtl\">אָמָה</span>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:5\" href=\"/Exodus.11.5\">Ex 11:5</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:41\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.41\">1 S 25:41</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָמָה</span>) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.17\">2 S 17:17</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶבֶד</span>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:16\" href=\"/Genesis.12.16\">Gn 12:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:35\" href=\"/Genesis.24.35\">24:35</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 20:14\" href=\"/Genesis.20.14\">20:14</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:43\" href=\"/Genesis.30.43\">30:43</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:6\" href=\"/Genesis.32.6\">32:6</a> (J; coll.) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:68\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.68\">Dt 28:68</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.16\">1 S 8:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.26\">2 K 5:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.2\">Is 14:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 34:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.34.9\">Je 34:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 34:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.34.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 34:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.34.11\">11</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 34:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.34.16\">16</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Joel 3:2\" href=\"/Joel.3.2\">Jo 3:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.7\">Ec 2:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.10\">2 Ch 28:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:4\" href=\"/Esther.7.4\">Est 7:4</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig. in address, <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁפְתָֽתְךָ</span>, etc., of speaker, in token of humility (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אָמָה\" href=\"/BDB,_אָמָה\", dir=\"rtl\">אָמָה</a>) <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:13\" href=\"/Ruth.2.13\">Ru 2:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:9\" href=\"/Ruth.3.9\">3:9</a>), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.18\">1 S 1:18</a> (‖ id. v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.16\">16</a>), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.27\">25:27</a> (‖ v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.24\">24 f.</a>), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.21\">28:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.6\">2 S 14:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.19\">19</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָמָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.16\">16</a>); <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.2\">2 K 4:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.16\">16</a>; not toward God; but v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אָמָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אָמָה\">אָמָה</a>."}],"num"